  - Natural A.R. 14 is recorded in natural_abilities.
  - Horror Factor 12 and Average P.P.E. 3D6 as printed.
  - "Attacks Per Melee Round: 2 or by O.C.C. and corresponding skills" is stored as attacks_base 2: a stated starting number, not an addition.
  - Bonuses: "+1 to pull punch and +2 to save vs magic". The save vs magic is one printed line and is stored on the five magic save keys (spell, ritual, illusionary, curses, faerie), the same reading the main-book dwarf carries.
  - UNDERGROUND SKILLS: Underground Tunneling (40% +5% per level), Underground Architecture (30% +5%; traps 15% +5%), Underground Sense of Direction (40% +5%; surface structures 30% +5%, -25% in an unfamiliar area) are printed under Natural Abilities with a Base Skill line each. The skill catalog holds no row by any of those names, so they are natural_abilities entries carrying the printed percentages, the shape the main-book dwarf, gnome and kobold take for the same three. The Baalizad trap figure is its own printed 15% +5% per level, not the dwarf''s half-of-architecture wording.
  - Plasma breath is limited to three times a day: stored as a trackable resource (max 3, reset each day) and described in natural_abilities. The damage figures (claw 1D8 or 2D4, pincer swipe 2D6, pincer grip 3D6, plasma 3D6 and 3D6 burning for 1D4 melees) are prose.
  - Arm configuration (one claw hand and one pincer for most; 25% symmetrical, split evenly between two claw hands and two pincers) is prose: the split is 12.5% each and is not a whole-number percentile table.
  - Magic: None. Psionics: "can only become minor psychics; roll as normal" - both are restrictions lines. No psionics block: the entry grants no power.
  - Languages: the native tongue is the Baalizad''s own and prints no percentage; nothing is granted here (the Vagabond/Peasant grants the native tongue at 98%). The learn-in-days rule (base percentage of the language skill, +5% per day, maximum 90%) is a natural ability in prose. The page calls the skill "Speak Languages".
  - MONEY AND EQUIPMENT: the entry prints neither; none stated.
  - Alignment (any, tending to good or selfish), size 7 feet and 400-500 pounds, life span about 100 years (one in 1,000 passes 800), habitat, enemies and allies are in the body.
